I ran into a really heinous bug last night, that killed my awesome valkyrie.
Spoilers ahead in the description of the situation.



I had been to the bottom of the gnomish mines, come back up and started back
down again.  Odin had given me Mjollnir, and I wished for gauntlets of power
so I could throw it.  I threw it at something, and killed it (awfully nice,
by the way).  Then I threw it at something else and I was booted to DOS with
an error message.  Being stupid, I forgot to write down the message, because
I didn't think I'd have a problem restoring the game.  I had compiled with
INSURANCE #defined and I didn't have !checkpoint in my config file (checkpoint,
according to the opthelp file, defaults to true), but when I ran recover, it
couldn't find the level 0 checkpoint file.  Ugh!  Brunhilde was awesome....

